## Stormy Slate Color System (DO NOT OVERRIDE)

Gold accent on slate neutrals — warm, authoritative, clinical.

### Light Mode
| Token | Hex | Role |
|---|---|---|
| `--color-bg-primary` | `#f8fafc` | Page canvas (Slate-50) |
| `--color-bg-secondary` | `#ffffff` | Cards, elevated surfaces |
| `--color-bg-tertiary` | `#f1f5f9` | Nested surfaces, inputs |
| `--color-accent` | `#9a8f72` | Gold — icons, highlights, decorative |
| `--color-accent-button` | `#7a6f52` | Gold for text-on-white and buttons (WCAG AA) |
| `--color-accent-light` | `#e8e4d8` | Tinted accent backgrounds |
| `--color-text-primary` | `#0f172a` | Headings, body (Slate-900) |
| `--color-text-secondary` | `#475569` | Supporting text (Slate-600) |
| `--color-text-muted` | `#64748b` | Labels, captions (Slate-500) |
| `--color-border` | `#e2e8f0` | Dividers, card outlines (Slate-200) |

### Dark Mode
| Token | Hex | Role |
|---|---|---|
| `--color-bg-primary` | `#101729` | Deep navy (NOT black) |
| `--color-bg-secondary` | `#1f283a` | Cards (Slate-800) |
| `--color-bg-tertiary` | `#2a3448` | Nested surfaces (Slate-700) |
| `--color-accent` | `#a89b7a` | Lighter gold for dark backgrounds |
| `--color-accent-button` | `#8a7f62` | Button gold |
| `--color-text-primary` | `#f1f5f9` | Headings, body (Slate-50) |
| `--color-text-secondary` | `#cbd5e1` | Supporting text (Slate-300) |
| `--color-text-muted` | `#94a3b8` | Labels, captions (Slate-400) |
| `--color-border` | `#334155` | Dividers (Slate-700) |

### Color Decisions
- **Data viz colors are muted slate grays** (not bright traffic lights): `--color-data-pass` Slate-600/400, `--color-data-fail` Slate-800/300, `--color-data-provisional` Slate-400/500
- **Semantic status** (`--color-success`, `--color-error`, `--color-warning`, `--color-info`) reserved for toasts, validation, system alerts — never on stat cards
- **WCAG:** `--color-accent` (#9a8f72) fails 4.5:1 on white. Use `--color-accent-button` (#7a6f52) for gold text on light backgrounds.

### Forbidden
- `#000000`, `bg-black`, `text-black` — use deep navy
- Blue/teal as primary accent
- Bright emerald/red/amber on stat cards or data displays
- Unthemed `gray-*` / `zinc-*` — use `slate-*` or CSS variables

