## Typography

| Family | Token | Weights | Actual Usage |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Inter** | `font-sans` | 400–700 | Everything: body, UI, forms, page titles, section headings, card titles |
| **Poppins** | `font-poppins` | 700 | Brand logo text only (`AppBrand.tsx`). Do not use for general headings. |
| **Teko** | `font-teko` | 400–700 | Display text in feature areas: calculator results, CalculatorHub title, library section headers, condition master titles. Not just KPI numbers. |

**Type scale in practice:** Page title `text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold` (Inter) · Section heading `text-xl font-bold` · Card title `font-bold` · Body `text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]` · Label `text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)] uppercase tracking-wider` · KPI number `text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tabular-nums`

Use `tabular-nums` / `.data-nums` on all numerical data in columns or stat cards.

