## Spacing, Layout & Depth

- **Content max-width:** `max-w-[var(--content-max-width,72rem)]` or `max-w-6xl`
- **Page padding:** `px-4 py-6` mobile, `px-6 py-8` desktop
- **Section gaps:** `mb-8` between sections, `mb-4` header-to-content
- **Card grids:** `grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4`
- **Card padding:** `p-4` compact, `p-5`/`p-6` standard

**Elevation model:** `bg-primary` → `bg-secondary` card + `border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl` → `bg-tertiary` chip. Shadows are blue-tinted `rgba(15,23,42,...)`, never pure black.

**Z-index:** Onboarding `z-[9999]` · ProductTour `z-[9998]` · Header `z-50` · NavRail `z-40` · Floating widgets `z-30` · Content `z-0`

