## Component Vocabulary (Use These — Don't Recreate)

| Component | Usage |
|---|---|
| **GlassCard** | Primary card. 5 variants (primary/success/warning/info/neutral). Neutral = `border-0`. Base = `rounded-xl`. |
| **Button** | 8 variants × 5 sizes. Base: `rounded-lg font-medium transition-colors`. Primary = `text-white`. |
| **EmptyState** | All "no data" views. 7 variants. Pre-configured: `EmptyStates.NoReviewsDue()`, `.NoStats()`, etc. |
| **SkeletonLoader** | Suspense fallbacks. Also: `QuickStatsBarSkeleton`, `Loader` (full-page). |
| **BackLink** | Back navigation at top of sub-pages. |
| **DrillShell** | Wrapper for all 13 drill types. |
| **MiniDrillLayout** | Immersive full-screen active quiz layout. |

**CSS classes (defined in `index.css`):**
- Widely used: `.btn-primary` · `.btn-secondary` · `.btn-ghost` · `.btn-glass` · `.btn-primary-cta` · `.focus-ring` · `.data-nums`
- Lightly used: `.kpi-label` (QuickStatsBar) · `.pill-select` / `.pill-select-active` (onboarding only)
- Defined but unused: `.kpi-metric` · `.kpi-context` · `.hover-lift` — these exist in CSS but have zero component references. Prefer inline Tailwind equivalents unless actively adopting these classes.

