## Accessibility

| Requirement | Implementation |
|---|---|
| Touch targets | `min-h-[44px]` on all interactive elements |
| Focus indicators | `focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--color-accent)] focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-none` |
| Color contrast | 4.5:1 normal text; gold on white must use `--color-accent-button` not `--color-accent` |
| Reduced motion | Gate all animations behind `useReducedMotion()` |
| Screen readers | `aria-label` on icon-only buttons, `aria-hidden="true"` on decorative icons |

---

## Anti-Patterns (Real Breakages)

| What Happened | The Rule |
|---|---|
| Global `transition-*` on `a, button, [role="button"]` broke all Framer Motion | Never add global transition rules to base elements |
| Data colors changed from slate to bright emerald/red/amber | Data colors are muted by design |
| `border` added to GlassCard base; `rounded-xl` → `rounded-2xl` | Never modify shared component base styles |
| Inline styles removed from LandingPage buttons | Inline styles on LandingPage are the safety net |
| Button base changed: `rounded-lg` → `rounded-xl`, `font-medium` → `font-semibold` | Never modify button primitive styling |
| CommandCenterHub layout restructured | Understand existing layout before changing it |
| 13 files changed in one batch | One file at a time. Verify before moving on. |

---

## Workflow

1. **Read** target file(s) first. Understand dependencies (does it use GlassCard? Button?).
2. **Propose** changes as text audit with exact className/JSX modifications and rationale.
3. **Implement** one file at a time with `Edit` tool. Use existing components (EmptyState, SkeletonLoader).
4. **Verify** via `git diff --stat` — only intended files should appear.

## Quality Gate

- [ ] Only CSS variables, no hardcoded hex
- [ ] Gold/slate preserved, no blue/teal
- [ ] Data colors muted slate, not bright semantic
- [ ] Works in light AND dark mode
- [ ] `prefers-reduced-motion` respected
- [ ] Touch targets ≥ 44px
- [ ] `focus-visible` on interactive elements
- [ ] `aria-label` on icon-only buttons
- [ ] No shared primitive changes
- [ ] No new dependencies
- [ ] Inline styles preserved on production components
- [ ] Numerical data uses `tabular-nums`
- [ ] Single primary CTA per screen
- [ ] `git diff --stat` shows only intended files
